  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Sankey Chart control visualizes flow and the proportional relationships between entities using directed paths with varying widths. It is ideal for representing energy flow, resource allocation, material flow, and multi-step process distributions. The control supports customizable nodes and links, color mapping, tooltip, legend, and interactive hover effects. It helps reveal patterns and proportions in flow-based data for analytical dashboards and reporting applications built on ASP.NET MVC.",
